# #5851 R4 (the coordinator's user-approved report fetch, owner d3dbbf69): an idle leaf's
# read-only fetch carries every bound an append response carries, the carried stale high included.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestFetchReportOmitsStaleHigh
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
PERTURBS: FetchReport
SUMMARY: the idle leaf's report fetch omits the carried stale high, so a stale donor's routed write under the old generation, which only the stale high bounds, lies below the fetched head and L free-advances past it unapplied
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, WithReportFetch = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, WithDuplicate = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ seenU' = [seenU EXCEPT ![a] = Max2(@, ReportU)]
    /\ ReportStale(a)
    /\ ft' = [ft EXCEPT ![a] = next - 1]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the fetch carries no stale high.
    /\ seenU' = [seenU EXCEPT ![a] = Max2(@, ReportU)]
    /\ UNCHANGED seenS
    /\ ft' = [ft EXCEPT ![a] = next - 1]
--- END
